{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience psychological horror in a 3rd Reich setting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 1944, on behalf of the OSS, you are sent to a waterworks near the Schneiden in the heart of Germany. According to reports, a Nazi scientist is researching how to resurrect fallen soldiers as ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the way there, Jason is haunted by ghostly apparitions and the cries of women and babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a legend in Schneiden about a woman in a white dress who was captured and killed by the Nazis together with her child. Since then, she is said to come back again and again to take revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/BB1.png?t=1745011688\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEAR of Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the German Wehrmacht and stop the Nazi scientist's paranormal experiments before it's too late.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way to fight \u201cErna\u201d the woman in the white dress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a world of shocking and paranormal events and face your fears as you unravel this terrifying mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/BB2.png?t=1745011688\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All light sources are dynamic and can be destroyed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The English and German languages are an integral part of the immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up-close action in many outdoor and indoor scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643800?t=1745011688","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/a5d2f41b4901024a0f5651b9e9d6d1c2f0bc4a04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745011688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/4eddcaafd8cbbe0fd2bb4fca5c1bcee808186444/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745011688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/4eddcaafd8cbbe0fd2bb4fca5c1bcee808186444/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745011688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game is not suitable for all ages, as in addition to psychological horror, there is frequent violence or violent, general mature content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience psychological horror in a 3rd Reich setting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 1944, on behalf of the OSS, you are sent to a waterworks near the Schneiden in the heart of Germany. According to reports, a Nazi scientist is researching how to resurrect fallen soldiers as ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the way there, Jason is haunted by ghostly apparitions and the cries of women and babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a legend in Schneiden about a woman in a white dress who was captured and killed by the Nazis together with her child. Since then, she is said to come back again and again to take revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/BB1.png?t=1745011688\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEAR of Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the German Wehrmacht and stop the Nazi scientist's paranormal experiments before it's too late.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way to fight \u201cErna\u201d the woman in the white dress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a world of shocking and paranormal events and face your fears as you unravel this terrifying mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/extras/BB2.png?t=1745011688\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All light sources are dynamic and can be destroyed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The English and German languages are an integral part of the immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up-close action in many outdoor and indoor scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Christian Bommert"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643800/40ddf29108d62b51858bd67b60ebcb0b5735246c/header.jpg?t=1745011688","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124152,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124152/movie480.mp4?t=1744545911","max":"